:: Chapter_01_Intro [chapter ch_01] {"position":"100,420","size":"100,100"}
(set: $current_chapter to 1)
## Chapter 1: The Midnight Dare in Cubicle Hell

> *Jordan arrives at the quirky modern real estate firm during a late-night overtime shift, the open-plan cubicles bathed in flickering fluorescent lights that already hint at instability. The air smells of burnt coffee and toner as he encounters char_sophia and char_finn, who dare him into a reckless flirtatious adventure with Sophia. Tension builds through playful banter and innuendo-filled dialogue, with Finn egging them on for laughs while Elena watches disapprovingly from her desk. The core crisis erupts when the pair sneaks into the CEO's office for privacy on a romantic dare, accidentally activating the time-shifting artifact hidden in the mahogany desk. A dramatic revelation occurs as Sophia begins shifting between reincarnated forms, delivering fragmented exposition about the Eternal Office Cabal ritual and warning of timeline collapse. Jordan makes an impulsive moral decision to chase the thrill rather than stop, triggering the first full era shift. The chapter climaxes with the office morphing around them in slapstick chaos, desks flipping into feast tables and phones ringing with medieval fanfares, propelling Jordan toward the CEO suite as the building cycles eras and leaving him ready to leap into the unknown medieval palace.*

**Setting:** `loc_modern_office`

